                        "content": "A client is recovering from abdominal surgery and has a large abdominal wound. The nurse would encourage the client to eat which food item that is naturally high in vitamin C to promote wound healing?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nCitrus fruits and juices are especially high in vitamin C. Bananas are high in potassium. Meats and dairy products are 2 food groups that are high in the B vitamins.\n\nTest-Taking Strategy:\nNote the subject, food items naturally high in vitamin C. It is necessary to recall that citrus fruits and juices are high in vitamin C; this will direct you to the correct option.",
